Design a 32-bit multiplier block that performs multiplication on the input data (i_data0) through a series of bitwise shifts and additions. The module implements a multiplication algorithm using shift-and-add techniques, generating the output (o_data0) as a result of manipulations involving the input signal and intermediate wire connections.
